eat. Stir in the spinach a handful at a time until it wilts, then stir in the cheese and the cream, if using.","uses":[10,11,12]},{"text":"Let the pasta stand for {time 2 min} so the sauce thickens slightly, then stir in the basil. Taste, add more salt if needed and serve with extra cheese on top.","uses":[13]}]}